                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]\nSuch old game of this caliber is always hard to recommend. Despite being slow paced and having low framerate there're some ideas and exploration involved. A bit wacky adventure where you play as an old fart and explore haunted castle full of different creatures. Don't become baldric should be your biggest concern here. Movement is annoying because it's flipped by 45 degrees making it a bit quirky. Overall gameplay is similar to old roguelike games  with some simple platforming, finding some items to use somewhere is common. Most of the time ppl check on such games just to check them up without even playing again. Final rating - fart out of ten.\n[/h1]",
